    ('reading-rdl-078b0e776a6259ad95655777', 'What can be inferred about food in the dining halls? 28. What can be inferred about food in the dining halls? Chefs will use organic ingredients in their plant-based dishes. Residence-hall dining rooms have offered vegan dishes in the past. Vegan dishes will be offered in some but not all dining halls. The changes to the dining hall offerings took effect at the beginning of the current semester. The article mentions each of the following EXCEPT 29. The article mentions each of the following EXCEPT motivations for choosing a vegan diet the views of one of the dining hall chefs whether dining halls will offer fewer animal-based dishes a source of inspiration for the new dishes that will be introduced The article mentions “carnivores” primarily to 30. The article mentions “carnivores” primarily to emphasize the tastiness of the new menu options explain why some people resist unfamiliar foods make an ethical claim about veganism note a health concern addressed by changes to dining hall offerings Beginning next semester, residence-hall
