    ('reading-rdl-0aa16b35f62265163607f011', 'What is the garden mainly used for? 21. What is the garden mainly used for? Providing herbs for campus dining services Teaching environmentally responsible gardening Conducting professional agricultural research Preserving rare medicinal plants What is suggested about the garden? 22. What is suggested about the garden? It is under threat of being closed. Students manage it independently from the university. It has grown significantly over time. It is popular among visitors to the campus. Herb Garden at Newton University
