    ('reading-rdl-0f91bfb6509c76a6a8e7dbc3', 'Eldric is concerned about adding the solar panels because it might 23. Eldric is concerned about adding the solar panels because it might require spending too much money at the beginning of the process be impossible given the library’s available rooftop space generate less energy than is needed to meet the library’s needs conflict with state rules about modifying existing buildings What can be inferred from Eldric’s mention of fundraising and seeking grants? 24. What can be inferred from Eldric’s mention of fundraising and seeking grants? He assumes that the university can cover costs through tuition increases. He believes that outside funding could make it feasible to install solar panels. He doubts that any external organization would support green initiatives. He feels that the university should not exceed its current budget. student.government.president@rowancourt.edu
