    ('reading-rdl-130cb0b27157e6b57ad263f5', 'Peter has no experience with spreadsheets and cannot attend class on Wednesdays. He should enroll in 25. Peter has no experience with spreadsheets and cannot attend class on Wednesdays. He should enroll in Section A Section B Section C Section D What does Michelle need before enrolling in Section D? 26. What does Michelle need before enrolling in Section D? Experience creating new spreadsheet formulas A research position that requires creating formulas Training in how to present complex data Previous experience using spreadsheets Beth has worked with formulas for years and is ready to learn advanced data skills. She should enroll in 27. Beth has worked with formulas for years and is ready to learn advanced data skills. She should enroll in Section A, B, or C Section D or E Section F Section G Downtown School of Data Skills
