    ('reading-rdl-1a583c195cab8b8638db55c7', 'What does the excerpt imply about the Organic Chemistry course? 21. What does the excerpt imply about the Organic Chemistry course? It covers multiple topics. It features field trips. It is graded as “pass” or “fail.” Any student can enroll. What is NOT mentioned as part of the coursework? 22. What is NOT mentioned as part of the coursework? Laboratory sessions Weekly quizzes Problem-based tasks Major examinations Organic Chemistry I
