    ('reading-rdl-408347bd0830937d81d90f46', 'What is the purpose of the email? 28. What is the purpose of the email? To request a deadline extension for a paper To share research findings with a colleague To seek clarification regarding grading criteria To ensure an instructor receives an assignment What does Daniel offer to do? 29. What does Daniel offer to do? Discuss feedback about a course Meet with Professor Lopez at 5:30 p.m. Submit the paper via the portal when it is operational Contact students who were affected by a technical problem What is NOT listed as being included in the paper? 30. What is NOT listed as being included in the paper? A list of recommended actions Works referenced in the report A brief summation of the content An analysis of renewable-energy sources Subject: Submission of renewable energy research paper
Dear Professor Lopez,
I am sending you my paper on “Renewable Energy Policies in Urban
Areas” by email because the online submission portal is down. I know
that you prefer not to receive student work this way, but I hope you
will understand, given the circumstances.
