Best regards,
Daniel Brooks'),
    ('reading-rdl-4119ca95e5e83595260956bd', 'What is the main purpose of the notice? 23. What is the main purpose of the notice? To promote a new study area in the library To announce changes to the library schedule To highlight student examination times To introduce new library resources What is indicated about weekends? 24. What is indicated about weekends? White Library''s weekend hours have not been extended. Students asked for round-the-clock weekend access to White Library. Exams will be held in White Library during weekends. Reservations are required for certain study areas in White Library during weekends. University Library Extends Hours
