    ('reading-rdl-4173e5fbe41ba56d482f6c87', 'According to the article, what is one goal of the new housing program? 23. According to the article, what is one goal of the new housing program? To convince international students to live on campus To create a feeling of connection among students To support the local residential construction economy To reduce the cost of dormitory maintenance Which initiative involves collaboration with outside organizations? 24. Which initiative involves collaboration with outside organizations? Renovated residential buildings Expanded employment opportunities Improved tutoring services Enhanced volunteering programs According to the article, what impact are the initiatives expected to have on students? 25. According to the article, what impact are the initiatives expected to have on students? They will not be affected. They will provide less feedback. Their satisfaction will increase. They will get priority course registration. Revitalizing Campus Life at
Ridgeview University
Ridgeview University has launched a series of initiatives for
enhancing student life this year. The university has introduced a
new housing program that provides affordable dormitories with
modern amenities. Aimed at fostering a sense of community, these
dormitories include common areas for socializing and studying.
In response to student feedback, the university has also expanded
its campus employment opportunities, offering over 200 new
positions in various departments. Additionally, Ridgeview is
boosting its volunteering programs through partnerships with
local nonprofit organizations, enabling students to earn credits
while making a positive impact in the community. “Our goal is to
create an environment where students can thrive academically and
socially,” said Evan Carrow, Dean of Student Life.
The student body has reacted positively, with many expressing
appreciation for the university’s efforts to adapt to their needs.
