    ('reading-rdl-41b5c8556113647593c73b66', 'What will Mr. Brown receive for free? 21. What will Mr. Brown receive for free? A bookmark A newsletter A book A catalog On what basis did GoodBooks make a decision? 22. On what basis did GoodBooks make a decision? A purchasing history A limited budget A reduced inventory A completed survey Subject:
