    ('reading-rdl-43cc9aa7d02ea4bf7faad149', 'What can be inferred about Elizabeth Wrenn? 23. What can be inferred about Elizabeth Wrenn? She enjoyed a film. She helped finance a film. She starred in a film. She produced a film. What can be concluded about The Kansas Kerfuffle? 24. What can be concluded about The Kansas Kerfuffle? Its plot is very formulaic and predictable. Its premiere took place in Kansas. It features a dispute about pet ownership. It offers a satirical view of small-town bureaucracy. Reviews and Opinions @CampusDaily
