    ('reading-rdl-491ff4497a8a83f1bc38bc82', 'What can be inferred about the lecture? 23. What can be inferred about the lecture? It is geared toward an audience well-versed in the field of botany. It will summarize the history of a field of scientific study. It addresses a subject that generates controversy among experts. It will be recorded so that those not in attendance can listen to it later. The announcement indicates that the lecture will address each of the following questions EXCEPT 24. The announcement indicates that the lecture will address each of the following questions EXCEPT whether plants possess intelligence how plants communicate with one another how plants adapt in response to stimuli whether plants can feel emotions Which of the following will be part of the lecture? 25. Which of the following will be part of the lecture? An opportunity for event attendees to ask questions An opportunity to meet Dr. Bell''s research assistants A demonstration of plant behavior A short film featuring Dr. Bell EVENT: "On the Question of Intelligence in Plants"
LECTURER: Dr. Cameron Bell, Professor of Botany
DATE: April 20 Time/Place: 8 P.M. at Richardson Hall
You are invited to attend an upcoming lecture titled
"The Question of Intelligence in Plants," presented by
professor of botany Dr. Cameron Bell.
This talk will explore one of the most intriguing frontiers
in modern biology: whether plants can be said to
possess forms of intelligence.
Drawing on recent research in plant signaling
communication, and adaptive behavior, the lecture
will challenge long-held assumptions about what it
means to show intelligence.
Attendees will gain insight into how plants process
information, interact with their environments, and
exhibit surprising capabilities that blur the boundaries
between reaction and cognition.
Dr. Bell will also survey and respond to the views of
scientists who are skeptical about ascribing intelligence
to plants. A discussion with audience members will
follow the lecture.'),
    ('reading-rdl-4c5d04b3ab7c4466f6edfbc2', 'When will Mr. Taylor receive his membership card? 21. When will Mr. Taylor receive his membership card? Within two business days Within three business days Within five business days Within seven business days How can Mr. Taylor learn about gym promotions? 22. How can Mr. Taylor learn about gym promotions? By downloading a mobile app By calling a representative By visiting a website By checking the mail Subject:
