    ('reading-rdl-502044d303afa26e7d169993', 'What is the main topic of the article? 23. What is the main topic of the article? The discovery of artifacts left by previous students The ending of a beloved campus tradition The renovation of a student residence hall The nostalgia over past hopes and dreams What is indicated about the time capsule itself? 24. What is indicated about the time capsule itself? It relied on twentieth-century technology. It was buried more than a century ago. It was empty when it was opened. Its contents were damaged. How did current students react to the discovery of the capsule? 25. How did current students react to the discovery of the capsule? They showed little interest in the discovery. They criticized the plan for the exhibition. They were inspired to imitate the students of 1896. They insisted that it be reburied. Time Capsule Unearthed During
Dorm Renovation
Construction crews renovating Murdoch Hall have discovered a
time capsule buried by students in the year 1896, sparking
excitement across campus.
Inside were letters, photographs, and a campus map showing
buildings long gone. "It''s like stepping into the past," said
archivist Dana Wells, who catalogued the items. Students lined
up to view the capsule''s contents, marveling at the artifacts.
"Seeing their hopes and dreams—it''s inspiring," said
junior Malik Johnson.
The university will host an exhibit next month featuring the
capsule''s contents alongside reflections from current students,
some of whom have expressed interest in contributing to a new
capsule, creating a bridge between the past and the present.
"It''s a reminder of how much has changed—and how
much hasn''t," Wells added.
The discovery has sparked conversations about campus
traditions and the importance of preserving history, turning a
routine renovation into a moment of shared pride and curiosity.'),
    ('reading-rdl-519b7ecfe106d69324a0ed4b', 'What is the main purpose of the notice? 23. What is the main purpose of the notice? To provide directions to a facility To announce the temporary closure of a facility To announce the relocation of a facility To explain improvements to a facility What happens to events that are scheduled during the renovations? 24. What happens to events that are scheduled during the renovations? They will be rescheduled for earlier dates. They will be rescheduled for later dates. They will no longer take place. They will be moved to a different location. Student Center Closure
