    ('reading-rdl-5d29cce150b67dbf0724d9b6', 'What is indicated about ENGL 101? 23. What is indicated about ENGL 101? It is open only to students majoring in English. Itengages with literature from a variety of genres. It centers on contemporary literary works. It requires prior coursework in literary studies. What is indicated about the learning activities that course participants will engage in? 24. What is indicated about the learning activities that course participants will engage in? They will be conducted both online and in person. They will involve group and individual assignments. They will include attending plays and poetry readings. They will involve archival research at the library. ENGL 101: Introduction to Literature
