    ('reading-rdl-6ca47f055e2571cb934669b3', 'What will probably occur during the period from July 2 to July 9? 21. What will probably occur during the period from July 2 to July 9? Repairs to a major campus street will take place. Classes on East Campus will be relocated to other areas. There will be a lot of noise on East Campus related to office renovations. A university office will be reviewing feedback about an upcoming project. What can be inferred about College Drive? 22. What can be inferred about College Drive? It will be unaffected by the project. It is located on East Campus. It is the site of the Facilities Office. Its road surface has been neglected. Sidewalk Repair Project
