    ('reading-rdl-7f007312dcc8c01ad8e20983', 'Supporting information is needed in order to complete which of the following processes? 25. Supporting information is needed in order to complete which of the following processes? A request for admission to an academic program Assessment of an annual departmental budget An application for funding for academic research An evaluation of a vendor''s proposal to provide services According to Dr. Anderson, all of the following are required from Ms. Gupta EXCEPT 26. According to Dr. Anderson, all of the following are required from Ms. Gupta EXCEPT a reason why she has included each item of equipment in her budget the identities of the vendors she intends to hire for services verification that she is enrolled in classes a PDF of the coursework she has completed to date What resource does Dr. Anderson offer in order to help Ms. Gupta accomplish the requested task? 27. What resource does Dr. Anderson offer in order to help Ms. Gupta accomplish the requested task? Sample scenarios for calculating her research budget Access to the university portal so she may download her schedule An official email documenting his endorsement of her proposal A list of the committee members reviewing her proposal Subject:
