    ('reading-rdl-7f0ecb70e33eb9aa07e717d8', 'What is the main purpose of the webpage? 23. What is the main purpose of the webpage? To provide historical background on campus transportation systems To critique existing public transit services available on campuses To introduce a new mobile app designed to simplify campus commuting To advertise rideshare companies to university students Who would benefit most from using the CampusConnect app? 24. Who would benefit most from using the CampusConnect app? International tourists visiting large metropolitan areas University students, faculty, and staff who do not own a car Professional city planners designing campus transit systems Students employed part-time as rideshare drivers What can be inferred about CampusConnect''s notification settings? 25. What can be inferred about CampusConnect''s notification settings? They are identical for all users in order to maintain consistency. They are set to a predetermined default profile that cannot be altered by users. They are designed to minimize user interaction with unnecessary alerts. They prioritize public transit notifications over rideshare notifications. CampusConnect
