    ('reading-rdl-8a2b06d3d54b3dbbc242334d', 'What can be concluded about Eli? 25. What can be concluded about Eli? He works at an appliance repair shop. He has repaired refrigerators in the past. He is studying to be a mechanical engineer. He meets with his math study group every week. At 4:48 P.M., what does Elena imply when she writes, “My economics class starts at noon”? 26. At 4:48 P.M., what does Elena imply when she writes, “My economics class starts at noon”? She has to arrive early to her economics class. Eli can work on the problem while she is in class. She cannot meet Eli at the time he has suggested. Her economics professor has changed the class start time. What does Eli suggest about Elena''s refrigerator? 27. What does Eli suggest about Elena''s refrigerator? It needs a new part. It cannot be repaired. It is a low-quality model. It must be brought to a shop. Elena Rowe (4:44 P.M.)
Hey Eli. I''m having a problem with my mini fridge. I hear the motor
humming, but it''s not cooling off. David from our history class tells me
you''re good at fixing things like this.
Could you come by and have a look?
Eli Molina (4:45 P.M.)
Hey Elena. I''d be happy to take a look. Right now I''m in the library with
my math study group. We just got here.
Elena Rowe (4:46 P.M.)
Oh, I didn''t mean right away. Any time is good.
Eli Molina (4:47 P.M.)
How about tomorrow at 12:30?
Elena Rowe (4:48 P.M.)
My economics class starts at noon. Does 1:30 work?
Eli Molina (4:50 P.M.)
That works fine. Chances are it''s a broken condenser coil. I''ve got an
extra one, so I''ll bring it with me.
Elena Rowe (4:51 P.M.)
Thank you so much!'),
    ('reading-rdl-8a9b85b65e1cbf69d70b34dc', 'The announcement includes which of the following? 23. The announcement includes which of the following? A description of a particular meditation technique A schedule for an ongoing meditation group Information about the workshop presenter Findings about the effects of mindfulness meditation The announcement suggests that workshop participants might expect each of the following EXCEPT 24. The announcement suggests that workshop participants might expect each of the following EXCEPT more restful nights a better ability to focus improved interpersonal skills a calmer mental and emotional state Mindfulness Workshop
