    ('reading-rdl-8d6a7440bee7c7fc9e571781', 'What is suggested about The Silent Echo''s setting? 21. What is suggested about The Silent Echo''s setting? It changes constantly throughout the narrative. It is harsh and unwelcoming. It plays an important role in the story. It is based on a real place. Which of the following is most likely true of The Silent Echo? 22. Which of the following is most likely true of The Silent Echo? It does not contain much dialogue. It is fast-paced and action-packed. Its main character is content with his life. It is the second book in a series. Review: The Silent Echo
