    ('reading-rdl-8e4510bcb065cbffbbeb9972', 'What is the purpose of the email? 25. What is the purpose of the email? To request equipment for a group presentation To request an extension on a deadline To ask for guidance about an assignment To ask for feedback on a recently submitted project What is supposed to happen on December 15? 26. What is supposed to happen on December 15? Sofia is meeting the professor to discuss the project. The group project must be presented to the class. The project topic must be approved by the professor. Sofia''s group is meeting to work on the project. What is Sofia''s request regarding country case studies? 27. What is Sofia''s request regarding country case studies? Her group would like to analyze three countries instead of two. Her group would like to focus on Japan and Brazil. Her group would like to analyze South Korea, Peru, and Ecuador. Her group would like to analyze five countries altogether. To:
Nguyen Hoang Anh
From:
Sofia Martinez
Date:
November 29, 9:41 P.M.
Subject:
Question about group project guidelines
Dear Professor Nguyen,
I wanted to confirm the expectations for our Global Marketing
Strategies group project. The syllabus mentions a
twenty-minute class presentation, but the assignment sheet
you gave us says fifteen minutes. Could you clarify which is
correct?
Also, the assignment calls for case studies from two
countries. Our group is planning to analyze Japan and Brazil,
but we thought there are some interesting points of
comparison with South Korea, Peru, and Ecuador. Would it be
alright if we added one of these as a third country?
Since the presentation is on Dec. 15, we want to ensure we’re
meeting all requirements at this stage.
Thank you for your help!
Best regards,
Sofia Martinez'),
    ('reading-rdl-93162d8f9d1db0491ad81016', 'The notice suggests that 23. The notice suggests that people new to photography can benefit from the workshop participants will leave campus to take pictures participants must pay an entrance fee students can learn fashion photography What would most likely be a part of the event on Sunday from 3:00 P.M. to 4:30 P.M.? 24. What would most likely be a part of the event on Sunday from 3:00 P.M. to 4:30 P.M.? An exhibition of participants’ photography A sale of used photo equipment A lecture by a university visual arts professor An opportunity to learn more photography techniques Which of the following is NOT true about the photography workshop? 25. Which of the following is NOT true about the photography workshop? There will be a photography competition. Photo editing methods will be presented. Multiple photography genres will be featured. Participants must pay for lunch. The University Photography Club
