    ('reading-rdl-a0d3ccce2d96e42f0bef903e', 'What is NOT indicated about Reflections? 21. What is NOT indicated about Reflections? It showcases modern art. It features artists from around the world. It is focused on several aspects of identity. It is the first in a series of exhibitions. What is true about the exhibition? 22. What is true about the exhibition? It is open after 6:00 p.m. on Mondays. It is open to the public at no cost. Its contents can be seen on a website. Its artworks are being offered for sale. Branford Center Art Exhibition
