    ('reading-rdl-a13078d5784dd9eb098fa58e', 'What is the reviewer''s main claim about Gardener''s Delight? 23. What is the reviewer''s main claim about Gardener''s Delight? It produces visible results almost immediately. It has produced one of the best garden plots on the campus. It performs better than many similar products. It has more nutrients than most soils on the market. The review mentions all of the following benefits of Gardener''s Delight EXCEPT: 24. The review mentions all of the following benefits of Gardener''s Delight EXCEPT: It is inexpensive. It supports fast growth. It is full of nutrients. It is easy to use. Gardener’s Delight Soil Mix
