    ('reading-rdl-a2cfcc36066cb5eaa00cd82e', 'How can members continue to have access to fitness services? 23. How can members continue to have access to fitness services? By joining the gym''s online workout sessions By going to another gym downtown By using the nearby high school gym By coming to the fitness center at certain hours On which of the following days can members use the fitness center? 24. On which of the following days can members use the fitness center? On October 1 On October 3 On October 7 On October 8 Gym Closure
