    ('reading-rdl-ad0163b3dd0f057a37e00907', 'Which category of student achievement is highlighted at the showcase? 28. Which category of student achievement is highlighted at the showcase? Athletic victories Research findings Memberships in honor societies High scores on examinations When will the Student Showcase take place? 29. When will the Student Showcase take place? March 25 April 10 April 15 April 16 What support is available for attendees? 30. What support is available for attendees? Stipends for travel to the expo and housing during the expo Onsite childcare for attendees who are parents Free abstract editing assistance for presenters Accommodations for attendees with accessibility needs Innovation Hub: Student Showcase
