    ('reading-rdl-afc5b258620dba4bf9e4d761', 'What is the main idea that drives the movie''s plot? 21. What is the main idea that drives the movie''s plot? A woman chases down enemies from her past. A woman is able to see terrible events in the future. A woman tries to change events in the past. A woman encounters herself in the future. What can be inferred about the film''s tone from the review? 22. What can be inferred about the film''s tone from the review? It combines sustained suspense with lighter moments. It relies primarily on visual spectacle rather than dialogue. It is quietly reflective and avoids emotional extremes. It is a gentle comedy with a few dramatic episodes. Review: Echoes of Tomorrow
