    ('reading-rdl-b173120bab5a5345b1a83638', 'What is the main purpose of the excerpt? 23. What is the main purpose of the excerpt? To outline the grading criteria for course assignments To summarize the course objectives and expectations To provide a reading list for the course To list all the major assignments for the course What is indicated about the guest lectures? 24. What is indicated about the guest lectures? They will be held every week. They will be delivered by professors from the university. They will feature writers who are well-known. They will include time for discussion. Literature 201:
