    ('reading-rdl-b417c2a5fcd0afdf6bc460fe', 'What is the likely reason for the reviewer to give the boots only four out of five stars? 23. What is the likely reason for the reviewer to give the boots only four out of five stars? They are not secure on slippery surfaces. They do not look very attractive. They are not fully waterproof. They are not the boots the reviewer had intended to purchase. What does the review suggest about the purchase of the boots? 24. What does the review suggest about the purchase of the boots? The reviewer bought the boots online. The cost was more than the reviewer had expected. The reviewer had to call the online store for advice. The reviewer received a discount as a hiking club member. TrailBlayzer hiking boots — Review
