    ('reading-rdl-b47b3f26fe6a421b6d4e94e4', 'What is the purpose of the email? 25. What is the purpose of the email? To schedule a career consultation To confirm enrollment in a program To request an opportunity for extra credit To submit an application for an internship What does Maria suggest in the email? 26. What does Maria suggest in the email? She is in her final year of studies. She works as a volunteer in a medical clinic. She is considering attending graduate school. She does not want to participate in extracurricular activities. What can be concluded about Dr. Patel? 27. What can be concluded about Dr. Patel? He teaches a course in introductory statistics. He specializes in environmental engineering. He directs the Edgefield Health Department. He has written about health interventions. Subject:
Request for career guidance meeting
Dear Dr. Patel,
I am exploring graduate programs in public health and would value
your advice regarding which ones are the most "up-and-coming" and
which are the most well-regarded. I am only a freshman, so is it too
early to start thinking about graduate school? I would also value your
perspective on which internships to pursue and what extracurricular
activities to participate in.
I would also like to discuss internship opportunities at the
Edgefield Health Department, since I''m interested in epidemiology.
I’ve reviewed your recent publication on community health
interventions and hope to learn how those strategies apply to
graduate research.
Could we meet next Tuesday at 3 P.M. in your office? If that time
doesn''t work, I''m available Thursday morning between 9 and 11 A.M.
Please let me know which time works best.
Thank you for your time.
Sincerely,
Maria Chen'),
    ('reading-rdl-b618e337f07d67448df7ad10', 'Why does Alex choose to contact Sarah in particular? 28. Why does Alex choose to contact Sarah in particular? Her profile indicated that she had a range of experiences at Behrens College. A faculty member recommended her to Alex. She had published advice for students entering the program. She is currently employed at a company where Alex hopes to work. What is suggested about Sarah''s relationship to Alex? 29. What is suggested about Sarah''s relationship to Alex? They were introduced through a mutual acquaintance. They share an academic field. They previously attended the same institution. They have already communicated through social media. What does the email suggest about Alex''s plans at Behrens College? 30. What does the email suggest about Alex''s plans at Behrens College? He intends to focus entirely on his coursework. He is mainly concerned with finding affordable housing near campus. He expects to participate in activities beyond his academic program. He has already identified specific internships he plans to apply for. To:
sarah.jones@alumni.behrens.edu
From:
alex.miller@student.behrens.edu
Sent:
October 12, 2:30 P.M.
Subject:
Advice on campus life and opportunities
Dear Sarah,
I hope this message finds you well. My name is Alex Miller, and I was
just accepted into the Computer Science program at Behrens College.
I found your profile in the "recent grads" section of the program''s
website and was impressed by your experiences both on and
off campus.
I was hoping you could share some insights into balancing academics
with extracurriculars. I am particularly interested in opportunities
aligned with technology and innovation. Additionally, I am curious
about your student housing experience. Do you recommend
on-campus living, or are the off-campus options better? Not much has
changed since you graduated last year.
Lastly, if you have any tips on securing internships or part-time work
related to our field, I would greatly appreciate it.
Thanks for your time and assistance.
Best regards.
Alex'),
    ('reading-rdl-b6336e0f1b9b15b76dd6dae8', 'What is suggested about the protagonist’s experience in the film? 21. What is suggested about the protagonist’s experience in the film? He stumbles upon a mystery affecting a forest’s ecology. He wins an award for scientific research. He struggles to find his way out of a forest. He encounters someone from his past. Who is Tomás Ruiz? 22. Who is Tomás Ruiz? A film director A film actor A film critic A character in a film The Review of Whispering Woods
