    ('reading-rdl-b88f4c4d1a372e13aad0e93c', 'What is NOT mentioned as a topic for the meeting? 25. What is NOT mentioned as a topic for the meeting? Finalizing the budget Updating a governing document Organizing activities for the spring semester Appointing new leadership At 4:51 p.m., what does Ryan imply when he writes, "If time permits"? 26. At 4:51 p.m., what does Ryan imply when he writes, "If time permits"? A vote on new club proposals will likely take place. University officials are not likely to approve any new clubs. Ella does not have the authority to propose topics for discussion. Other topics have higher priority than the one mentioned by Ella. Which of the following is part of Ryan''s role? 27. Which of the following is part of Ryan''s role? Compiling the minutes during the meeting Preparing materials and equipment for the meeting Keeping track of the time during the meeting Bringing snacks for council members at the meeting Ella Morcant (4:45 P.M.):
