    ('reading-rdl-c70b5205e7cc1b2295352734', 'What is the main purpose of the email? 25. What is the main purpose of the email? To confirm the deadline for an assignment To ask for an extension on a project To thank a faculty member for their help To ask for comments on a paper The message mentions Professor Carter doing each of the following EXCEPT 26. The message mentions Professor Carter doing each of the following EXCEPT meeting Micah during office hours reading Micah’s thesis proposal providing extra materials to Micah helping Micah choose a thesis topic In the next few days, Micah will most likely 27. In the next few days, Micah will most likely seek feedback from another professor update his proposal outline meet with Professor Carter again continue revising his entire proposal mica.agst@dmail.com
From:
Subject:
My thesis proposal
Dear Professor Carter,
I just want to express my appreciation for your thoughtful feedback on
my thesis proposal about renewable-energy adoption. Your notes on
tightening the methodology and adding comparative case studies were
very helpful and gave me a clearer path forward. I have already updated
my outline with those changes and plan to send the revised version of
the entire proposal next Monday.
I also really appreciate you making time during office hours to discuss
my questions with me and for sharing the relevant policy-analysis
resources—they are exactly what I need. Your support has made a real
difference in how I''m approaching this work, and I feel much more
confident about the next steps. I am sincerely grateful for all you have
done for me.
Best regards,
Micah Agostino'),
    ('reading-rdl-c849d537afb39dac106e67a6', 'What is the general aim of the Study Abroad Expo? 28. What is the general aim of the Study Abroad Expo? To evaluate emerging risks in a variety of sectors in the field of global education To facilitate a deep understanding of opportunities for international learning To highlight the historical significance of student exchange programs To promote the sale of travel-related merchandise intended for students What is suggested about the Sustainable Study Abroad panel? 29. What is suggested about the Sustainable Study Abroad panel? It will mainly address the costs of studying abroad for students. It will show the need to integrate eco-friendly practices into study abroad programs. It will examine the impact of studying abroad on student environmental consciousness. It will primarily focus on the legal aspects of participating in study abroad programs. Which of the following aspects of study abroad programs might Dr. Kim’s keynote speech address? 30. Which of the following aspects of study abroad programs might Dr. Kim’s keynote speech address? The possible influence of emerging technologies Existing patterns of participation in study abroad programs The allure of traditional study abroad destinations The benefits of current study abroad program policies Study Abroad Expo
