    ('reading-rdl-ddc016d127ad461b5baa9a13', 'What is the most recent debating event that Noam attended? 23. What is the most recent debating event that Noam attended? A high school tournament in which he competed An introductory session held by the university club An intercollegiate debate on international trade policies A workshop offered by the university club Why does Noam mention “both parliamentary and policy debate formats”? 24. Why does Noam mention “both parliamentary and policy debate formats”? To inquire about which debate format the Debate Club prefers To indicate the breadth of his debating background To highlight what he learned at a recent Debate Club event To suggest a topic for a future workshop Why does Noam ask how much time the Debate Club will require of him? 25. Why does Noam ask how much time the Debate Club will require of him? He is trying to decide how many university clubs he should join. He is wondering whether additional training will be required. He is considering becoming an officer of the Debate Club. He is experiencing a heavy academic workload. Debate Club Coordinator
