    ('reading-rdl-e47299f57a8775477cec8e31', 'It can be inferred that the course will include which of the following? 23. It can be inferred that the course will include which of the following? Attendance of a theatrical production Collaboration between students Quizzes on individual plays Biographical study of various monarchs Which of the following is an organizing principle of the course? 24. Which of the following is an organizing principle of the course? A particular theme A particular type of play A historical overview of Shakespeare''s world A comparison of different theatrical productions LIT304 Shakespeare''s Kings
