    ('reading-rdl-f40ed125b66e539ea9e27f84', 'How will the library''s schedule change during final exams? 23. How will the library''s schedule change during final exams? Study rooms will be unavailable after 10 p.m. starting April 22. The library will begin opening an hour earlier starting April 22. Weekend hours will be reduced after April 22 to allow for maintenance. The library''s closing time will be later starting April 22. Which feature is newly added to study rooms during the library''s altered schedule for final exams? 24. Which feature is newly added to study rooms during the library''s altered schedule for final exams? Additional drink choices The ability to print documents Faster help from librarians Increased seating capacity EXTENDED LIBRARY HOURS FOR FINAL EXAMS
