per week to this role. Please let me know if you need
any additional materials or references. Thank you for
your consideration.
Sincerely,
Ethan Li'),
    ('reading-rdl-f6ebe702d14e8faa510a9fbb', 'It can be inferred that Olivia and Ben both value 25. It can be inferred that Olivia and Ben both value classes that make minimal demands on students classes that focus on theoretical modeling instructors who have practical experience instructors who have published extensively Ben will contact his advisor to 26. Ben will contact his advisor to learn about a professor''s teaching assignment find out if registration for the next semester has started determine how many credits he needs to graduate learn if the advisor values Professor Gupta''s expertise What can be inferred about Olivia from her remark at 4:59 p.m.: "Professor Gupta could open doors for research and global policy networking"? 27. What can be inferred about Olivia from her remark at 4:59 p.m.: "Professor Gupta could open doors for research and global policy networking"? She knows Professor Gupta personally. She has decided to apply to a PhD program next year. She prefers courses that avoid international perspectives on economics. She is interested in opportunities that extend beyond classroom learning. Olivia Haverkamp (4:45 P.M.)
